@Ordering.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5180

### Pedido con stock suficiente -> OrderConfirmed
# @name placeOk
POST {{Ordering.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerEmail": "cliente@demo.com",
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Consultar estado (repetir tras unos segundos: Pending -> Confirmed)
GET {{Ordering.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{placeOk.response.body.id}}
Accept: application/json

### Pedido sin stock (el producto 3 tiene 0) -> OrderRejected
POST {{Ordering.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerEmail": "cliente@demo.com",
  "items": [
    { "productId": 3, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

###
